IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
AUTHOR. 'TREVOR LITTLE'.
PROGRAM-ID. PARSE-STRING.

DATA DIVISION.
  WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    01 WS-WORD PIC X(50) VALUE 'HELLO WORLD!'.
    01 WS-LENGTH PIC 9(6).
    01 WS-I PIC 9(6) VALUE 1.
    
  
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(WS-WORD) TO WS-LENGTH.

  PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-LENGTH
    DISPLAY WS-WORD(WS-I:1)
  END-PERFORM.
  
STOP RUN.
